    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PREVENTION OF FRAUDS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 70)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.9,
      288.23
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      301.49,
      401.88,
      325.19
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Prevention of Frauds(Amendment) Act, No\u2026\u2026of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      338.45,
      401.88,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 2 of the Prevention of Frauds Ordinance(Chapter 70) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      174.09,
      387.65,
      401.89,
      398.99
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the renumbering of that section as subsection (1);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      174.09,
      412.25,
      401.87,
      448.19
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the repeal of all the words from \u201cshall be of force\u201dto the end of renumbered subsection (1) of that sectionand the substitution therefore of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      201.81,
      461.45,
      368.04,
      472.79
    ],
    "text": "\u201cshall be in force or avail in law unless \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      211.05,
      486.05,
      401.88,
      546.59
    ],
    "text": "(a) the relevant deed or instrument shall be inwriting, signed by every executant orauthorized person of such executant andattested by a notary public before twowitnesses present at the same time; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      211.05,
      559.85,
      401.92,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(b) the left or right thumb impression of everysuch executant or his authorized person orwhere both thumbs of such executant or hisauthorized person are missing, theimpression of any other finger or the toeimpression as the case may be, is affixedabove or besides the signature to theoriginal, duplicate and the protocol of therelevant deed or instrument:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      339.55,
      451.29,
      377.42
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 2ofChapter 70",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      350.38,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "2 Prevention of Frauds (Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      223.15,
      202.97,
      397.19,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, in the event thesignature or the thumb impression of anysuch executant or his authorized personcannot be obtained due to any reason, thenotary public shall state such reason in theattestation, and such executant or hisauthorized person shall affix any otherfinger impression or toe impression, as thecase may be.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      322.97,
      397.16,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "(3) by the addition immediately after subsection (1) ofthat section, of the following new subsection:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      197.71,
      358.97,
      337.77,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) In relation to a transfer deed \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      228.91,
      382.97,
      397.17,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "(a) both the transferor and the transfereeshall affix their signatures and thumbimpressions as required by subsection(1); and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      228.91,
      442.97,
      397.18,
      526.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) if the transferee is a minor, the legalguardian or guardian or the personauthorized by the legal guardian orguardian as the case may be, shall bea competent person to act on behalfof the transferee for the purpose of thissection.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      538.97,
      397.18,
      562.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 4 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      574.97,
      397.23,
      586.31
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the renumbering of that section as subsection (1);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      598.97,
      397.23,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the repeal of all the words from \u201cin the mannerhereinafter mentioned;\u201d to the end of renumberedsubsection (1) of that section and the substitutiontherefor of the words \u201csubject to the provisionsspecified in subsection (2) or (3) as the case maybe.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
