    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      204.05,
      401.86,
      229.19
    ],
    "text": "(3) by the addition immediately after subsection (1) ofthat section, the following new subsections: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      202.29,
      245.21,
      399.33,
      256.55
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) The testator or his authorized person shall \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      228.57,
      272.57,
      283.65,
      283.91
    ],
    "text": "(a) sign; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      228.57,
      300.05,
      401.87,
      311.39
    ],
    "text": "(b) affix his left or right thumb impression,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      201.81,
      327.41,
      401.88,
      379.79
    ],
    "text": "at the foot or end of the will, testament or codicilreferred to in subsection (1), before a notary publicand two witnesses who shall be present at the sametime:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      201.81,
      395.93,
      401.88,
      461.99
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, in the event the thumbimpression of the testator or of his authorizedperson cannot be obtained due to any reason, heshall affix any other finger impression or the toeimpression, as the case may be.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      201.81,
      478.13,
      401.88,
      557.87
    ],
    "text": "(3) (a) If the testator is not in a position to complywith the requirements specified in paragraph (a)of subsection (2), he may authorize any otherperson to sign on behalf of him, and shall complywith the requirements specified in paragraph (b)of subsection (2).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      201.81,
      574.01,
      401.89,
      667.55
    ],
    "text": "(b) If the testator is not in a position to complywith the requirements specified in paragraphs (a)and (b) of subsection (2), he may authorize anyother person to sign and affix the left or right thumbimpression or any other finger impression or thetoe impression as the case may be, of such person,on behalf of him.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      147.57,
      300.41,
      152.57,
      311.75
    ],
    "text": "5",
